@token = ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@placeId = 1

### 주변 장소 전체 검색 (반경 1km)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/places?lat=37.5665&lng=126.9780&radius=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 주변 동물병원만 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/api/places?lat=37.5665&lng=126.9780&radius=1000&category=HOSPITAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 장소 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/places/{{placeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 장소 직접 등록 (크라우드소싱)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "우리동네 동물병원",
  "category": "HOSPITAL",
  "address": "서울시 중구 테스트로 1",
  "lat": 37.5665,
  "lng": 126.9780,
  "phone": "02-1234-5678",
  "isOpen24h": false,
  "isEmergency": false,
  "allowsDogs": true
}

###

### 도움이 됐어요 투표
POST http://localhost:8080/api/places/{{placeId}}/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voteType": "HELPFUL"
}

###

### 도움 안됐어요 투표
POST http://localhost:8080/api/places/{{placeId}}/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voteType": "NOT_HELPFUL"
}

###
